OL,6,G0300 The Staircase
OL,7,     FIn 2001, Kathleen prepares for a
OL,8,     FChristmas to remember despite the
OL,9,     Ffamily's ever-mounting financial
OL,10,     Fwoes. Years later, Sophie
OL,11,     Fcontinues her quest to prove
OL,12,     FMichael's innocence after a body
OL,13,     Fwith similar injuries to
OL,14,     FKathleen's arrives in the county
OL,15,     Fmorgue. Meanwhile, questions about
OL,16,     Fthe state's justice system surface
OL,17,     Fthat could turn the tide of the
OL,18,     FPeterson case, and Martha decides
OL,19,     Fto dig into her fraught past,
OL,20,     Fdespite pushback from Margaret
